{"symbol":"ADISHAKTI","yahoo":"ADISHAKTI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Afloat Enterprises Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","website":"https://adishaktiloha.com","about":"Afloat Enterprises Limited primarily engages in the manufacture, production, procurement, conversion, buying, sale, and trading of iron and steel products in India. The company also deals in diamonds, gold bars coins, tin plates, ETP sheets, TFS, scraps, mild steel products, carbon steels, and stainless products. In addition, it sells, buys, trades, imports, and exports food grains, such as food grains including wheat products, rice, rice products, and other kinds of cereals, as well as paddies, corn, oil, and other commodities. The company was formerly known as Adishakti Loha and Ispat Limited and changed its name to Afloat Enterprises Limited in October 2023. Afloat Enterprises Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in New Delhi, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:06:07+00:00","quote":{"price":6.13,"prevClose":6.5,"marketCap":7.7,"high52":15.5,"low52":5.76,"pe":null,"bookValue":12.44,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":0.0,"shares":1.2558,"insiders":66.0,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-10-13","2021-10-14","2021-10-18","2021-10-19","2021-10-20","2021-10-21","2021-10-22","2021-10-25","2021-10-26","2021-10-27","2021-10-28","2021-10-29","2021-11-01","2021-11-02","2021-11-03","2021-11-04","2021-11-08","2021-11-09","2021-11-10","2021-11-11","2021-11-12","2021-11-15","2021-11-16","2021-11-17","2021-11-18","2021-11-22","2021-11-23","2021-11-24","2021-11-25","2021-11-26","2021-11-29","2021-11-30","2021-12-01","2021-12-02","2021-12-03","2021-12-06","2021-12-07","2021-12-08","2021-12-09","2021-12-10","2021-12-13","2021-12-14","2021-12-15","2021-12-16","2021-12-17","2021-12-20","2021-12-21","2021-12-22","2021-12-23","2021-12-24","2021-12-27","2021-12-28","2021-12-29","2021-12-30","2021-12-31","2022-01-03","2022-01-04","2022-01-05","2022-01-06","2022-01-07","2022-01-10","2022-